#=============================================================================
# PARAMETER RATIONALE AND NOTES
#=============================================================================
# Parameter Selection Criteria:
# 1. Rii values based on experimental van der Waals radii
# 2. epsii values scaled appropriately for metal-ligand interactions
# 3. Solvation volumes consistent with metal size and hydration
# 4. All metals use bond_index = 4 (standard for metals in AutoDock)
# 5. solpar = -0.00110 for all metals (consistent with existing parameters)
#
# Common Metals in Drug Design:
# - Zn, Mg, Ca, Fe, Cu: Essential biological metals
# - Pt, Au, Pd: Anticancer drug components
# - Li: Psychiatric medications
# - Gd: MRI contrast agents
# - Mo: Enzyme cofactor
